window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Some battles never truly end. Some ghosts refuse to rest.</b></p> <p>When an ambitious TV treasure hunter unearths a hidden British redoubt near Yorktown, he believes he's struck gold—both figuratively and literally. But as the excavation begins, reports of eerie voices, sudden accidents, and chilling apparitions start to surface. What should have been a routine historical dig quickly spirals into something far more sinister.</p> <p>Captain Leah Morgan and her team at the Legacy Operations Command are deployed to investigate the disturbances, only to discover that the excavation has awakened something ancient and angry. The battlefield that once saw the last stand of the British Army has become a haunting ground for spirits unwilling to fade into history.</p> <p>As Leah digs deeper, she unravels a deadly conspiracy tied to an artifact of immense power—one that certain dark forces are willing to kill for. With the past bleeding into the present and time running out, she must race to contain the threat before Yorktown's haunted history turns into a supernatural war zone.</p> <p><b>The past is restless, and the ghosts are waking up. Join the hunt before history repeats itself . . . in blood.</b></p>"; 
